Python is an external prerequisite. The application prepares a separate Graphviz
runtime in a private cache. Graphviz and its dependencies retain their own
licenses; their notices and source references accompany each runtime artifact.
No Twine source code or third-party layout-engine binaries are included in the
application's wheel or source distribution. ELK.js and Node.js were used only
for experiments. See docs/third-party.md for the dependency inventory and source
references.

